"Test" by nico ailani carlson

Include Conversation Framework by Eric Eve.

The Test Room is a room. "This test room is a test room."

Derrell is a [undescribed] man in the Test Room. "Derrell is pretty cool, he's here in the Test Room."

Himself is a subject. Understand "Derrell", "him", "self" as Himself.

After quizzing Derrell about Himself:
	try quizzing Derrell about Derrell;
	
After quizzing Derrell about Derrell:
	say "You ask Derrell about himself. He says some cool stuff.";